1: /**
2:  * Cinejoy webOS - Media Player Engine & 10-Foot TV Playback Overlay
3:  * File: app/js/player.js
4:  * Standard: 10-Foot Television UX, webOS 8.5.0 (Chromium ~108+)
5:  * Target Device: LG 32LR686BPSA (1920x1080 Full HD Canvas)
6:  * 
7:  * Incorporates:
8:  * - window.PlayerController: Core playback engine, Hls.js low-memory profile,
9:  *   proxy stream resolution, multi-server fallback, WebVTT subtitle ingestion,
10:  *   resume position tracking, and 5-stage deterministic teardown.
11:  * - window.PlayerOSDController: 10-foot TV HUD overlay, 4000ms auto-hide timer,
12:  *   timeline scrubber, remote key mappings, subtitle/server modal dialogs,
13:  *   buffering spinner, and error recovery.
14:  */
